@format 1
@id audio.reorder-steps
@title Reorder audio processing steps
@area Audio
@entry input
@summary Move one ordered audio processing step by its buttons or drag operation, renumber the list, and request persistence of the changed order.
@flow TB
@related audio.save-plan

@alias processing = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PProcessing
@alias tab = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PAudioTab

[input] Reorder requested <input>
- Move the selected step with an order button @ processing.PProcessingStepMove(...)
- Or move the dragged row and commit its changed order on release @ processing.PProcessingMoveHandle(...)
@ processing.PProcessingUpHandle(...)
> move

[move] Apply new order <decision>
- Validate the selected index and target position, then move the row and renumber ordered steps @ processing.PProcessingStepMove(...)
? "No eligible move occurs" > unchanged
? "A step changes position" > persist

[persist] Request plan persistence <output>
- Publish the ordered-list change after a button move or a completed drag @ processing.PProcessingStepMove(...)
@ processing.PProcessingUpHandle(...)
- Receive the ordered-list event and save the active source plan @ tab.PAudioTab(...)
> map:audio.save-plan

[unchanged] Order unchanged <output>
= The existing audio processing order remains in effect.
